<title>HONG KONG: Asian Banking Corp sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Asian Banking Corp sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by bookrunner Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>BORROWER  ASIAN BANKING CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$100 MLN  COUPON	6ML+65BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE   PAR	 LAUNCH    21.APR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3 &amp; 4    CALLS	 --	  REPLIES   02.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT   BULLET    DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATING    --	    SALE LMTS   STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF     YES	 FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW     --	  PAY DATE  13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FEES	30BP FLAT</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS     US$10 MLN AND ABOVE</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS	US$5-7 MLN</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		 US$2-4 MLN</p>
<p>ARRANGER DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL (BOOKS)</p>
<p> NOTES    WITH FEES, THE ALL-IN RETURN IS 75 BASIS POINTS OVER</p>
<p>	    LIBOR TO THE FIRST PUT OPTION</p>
<p>	    SETTLEMENT THROUGHT EUROCLEAR/CEDEL.</p>
<p>	    SIGNING IS SET FOR MAY 7</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
